<title>CANADA: London Insurance in talks with RBC.</title>
<headline>London Insurance in talks with RBC.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Insurance Group and Trilon Financial Corp said on Tuesday said they were in talks with Royal Bank of Canada about the potential sale of London to Royal, Canada's biggest bank.</p>
<p>The companies said they planned to make an announcement shortly pending an agreement or discussions being terminated.</p>
</text>
